    "updated_at": "2025-04-12T05:23:39Z",
    "body": "This would be great! I get a decent number of timeouts on node.js despite not showing the version string:\n\n```toml\n[nodejs]\nformat = '[$symbol]($style)'\n```\n\nSince I'm not using the version, I wouldn't expect the `node` binary to ever be called, so IMO this shouldn't ever time out.",
